    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game designed specifically for <strong>Taiwanese 16-Tile Mahjong</strong>, allowing players to enjoy the most authentic mahjong experience anytime, anywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Mahjong Introduction &amp; Tutorial</strong> \u2013 Even if you've never played Mahjong before, you can quickly get started with detailed tutorials and guided instructions! <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multiplayer Online Matches</strong> \u2013 Supports <strong>up to 4 players</strong>, so you can compete with friends and experience exciting mahjong battles! <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Smart AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>four difficulty levels</strong>, ranging from beginner to expert, to match your skill level!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Voice Announcements</strong> \u2013 Stay focused on the game without staring at the screen \u2013 <strong>hear what tiles your opponents play</strong> through the voice system!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Track your game results and financial growth as you progress from a novice to a mahjong master!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Casual Mode</strong> \u2013 Want to relax? Enjoy stress-free games with no pressure, just pure mahjong fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for competitive play or a casual gaming experience, this game has something for everyone! Come challenge <strong>Taiwanese 16-Tile Mahjong</strong> and enjoy the classic thrill of the game! \ud83c\udf89</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game designed specifically for <strong>Taiwanese 16-Tile Mahjong</strong>, allowing players to enjoy the most authentic mahjong experience anytime, anywhere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Mahjong Introduction &amp; Tutorial</strong> \u2013 Even if you've never played Mahjong before, you can quickly get started with detailed tutorials and guided instructions! <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multiplayer Online Matches</strong> \u2013 Supports <strong>up to 4 players</strong>, so you can compete with friends and experience exciting mahjong battles! <br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Smart AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Choose from <strong>four difficulty levels</strong>, ranging from beginner to expert, to match your skill level!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Voice Announcements</strong> \u2013 Stay focused on the game without staring at the screen \u2013 <strong>hear what tiles your opponents play</strong> through the voice system!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Track your game results and financial growth as you progress from a novice to a mahjong master!<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Casual Mode</strong> \u2013 Want to relax? Enjoy stress-free games with no pressure, just pure mahjong fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for competitive play or a casual gaming experience, this game has something for everyone! Come challenge <strong>Taiwanese 16-Tile Mahjong</strong> and enjoy the classic thrill of the game! \ud83c\udf89</p>",
